If you need RECEIPT-1 even when FAIL — format

Fail-closed runner must emit same schema but status: FAIL:
{
  "schema": "AQARION-RUN-RECEIPT-1",
  "generated_at": "2026-09-16T19:00:00+00:00",
  "repository_root": "/home/runner/work/Aqarions-Quantarion-AI/Aqarions-Quantarion-AI",
  "manifest": "verification/manifest.json",
  "status": "FAIL",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "AQ-S14-SEMANTIC-K3",
      "status": "FAIL",
      "returncode": 1
    }
  ]
}
Rule:
PASS only when every registered check exit 0
FAIL when any check exit !=0, manifest malformed, missing executable, etc.
RECEIPT-1 does NOT contain commit SHA — that's why you need RECEIPT-2 for portable provenance.

